 verts to Islam. Will he avoid the trap of isolation and violence? Director
  Federico Ferrone scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-an
 d-events/cinema-italian-style-2025/the-best-reward\n\nEstimated start: 16:
 30
