SUMMARY:Wolf Land
DTSTART:20251123T010000Z
DTEND:20251123T023000Z
DTSTAMP:20251123T010000Z
UID:rcl3XxjAdx
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 71 mins (1h11m)\n\nSeattle Film Critics Society Paci
 fic Northwest Awards Range rider and “wolf-protecting cowboy” Daniel C
 urry and cattle rancher Jerry Francis try to find common ground between th
 eir conflicting interests in the forests of northeastern Washington\, just
  20 miles from the Canadian border. Director Sarah Hoffman\, Editor David 
 Wulzen\, Director of Photography Bryce Yukio Adolphson\, and Executive Pro
 ducer Sarah Menzies scheduled to attend for introduction and Q&A.\n\nhttps
 ://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/seattle-film-critics-society-pnw-award
 s-2025/wolf-land\n\nEstimated start: 17:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
