BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:My Undesirable Friends: 1-3
DTSTART:20251128T223000Z
DTEND:20251129T021500Z
DTSTAMP:20251128T223000Z
UID:YeBhLqxCVJ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 208 mins (3h28m)\n\nMy Undesirable Friends: Part I -
  Last Air in Moscow What begins as an intimate portrait of Russian indepen
 dent journalists facing persecution by Putin’s regime takes a drastic tu
 rn when Russia starts a full-scale war in Ukraine and they are all forced 
 into exile. The film offers a front row seat to how authoritarianism works
  and the lives of those who resist\, which becomes all the more globally r
 elevant every day. Total running time for this screening is 208 minutes\, 
 including a 10 minute intermission between Chapters 2 and 3.  Chapter 1: T
 he Lives of Foreign Agents (81 min.)Chapter 2: The Town Crazies (61 min.)
 Intermission (10 min.)Chapter 3: The Holiday Special (56 min.) Chapters 4-
 5 will be screened separately.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events
 /my-undesirable-friends-part-i-last-air-in-moscow/my-undesirable-friends-p
 art-i-last-air-in-moscow-chapters-1-3\n\nEstimated start: 14:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:My Undesirable Friends: 4-5
DTSTART:20251129T030000Z
DTEND:20251129T052000Z
DTSTAMP:20251129T030000Z
UID:0EXcJ8XoPp
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 125 mins (2h05m)\n\nMy Undesirable Friends: Part I -
  Last Air in Moscow What begins as an intimate portrait of Russian indepen
 dent journalists facing persecution by Putin’s regime takes a drastic tu
 rn when Russia starts a full-scale war in Ukraine and they are all forced 
 into exile. The film offers a front row seat to how authoritarianism works
  and the lives of those who resist\, which becomes all the more globally r
 elevant every day. Chapter 4: The Expected Impossible (57 min.)Chapter 5: 
